{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Demo Version now available!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The demo includes content from Day 1 and Day 2.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everyone can experience the flow, overall atmosphere, and story tone! (\uff1e\u4eba\uff1c;)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even though we're close to release and working on finalizing the main game (so major framework changes might be difficult), we will definitely fix any bugs with full effort! If you find any bugs, please send them to our email: <a href=\"mailto:1937396015@qq.com\">1937396015@qq.com</a></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you're interested after playing, please consider adding it to your wishlist! Thank you so much! For a small, unknown indie game like ours, this is <i>really</i>\u2014incredibly important! Every single &quot;+1&quot; from everyone is the motivation that keeps us going!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Trapped for 7 Days with a Yandere Girl? Yandere Heroine \u00d7 Anime Style  GAL Game!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967210/extras/bfaf03edbf9aeca394e9adb58097f299.avif?t=1756640696\" data-has-big width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967210/extras/2fd9f107f11b6bb90fa1c53bdf2a6255.avif?t=1756640696\" data-has-big width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967210/extras/0d191920d0e33c82e4dbc7729a810f73.poster.avif?t=1756640696\" width=780 height=42 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967210/extras/0d191920d0e33c82e4dbc7729a810f73.webm?t=1756640696\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;A world with just the two of us left... isn't that happiness for you?&quot;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up with lost memories, finding yourself trapped in the entrance of an unfamiliar room. And appearing before [you] is... a strange pink-haired girl.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Although she constantly showers you with words of love, she refuses to let you go and evades any serious questions, unwilling to tell you the whole truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Moreover, her mood shifts abnormally fast; she's very emotionally unstable. If you're not careful, you'll step on her landmines...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guess it's true that pink-haired girls are black on the inside?!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967210/extras/7f141786882ca7580f8057aea113207a.poster.avif?t=1756640696\" width=780 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967210/extras/7f141786882ca7580f8057aea113207a.webm?t=1756640696\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967210/extras/7f141786882ca7580f8057aea113207a.mp4?t=1756640696\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Yandere Mode: OFF \u2191</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Yandere Mode: ON \u2193</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967210/extras/c3c19e3e4f3bc4fe6540f43cafc9bf59.poster.avif?t=1756640696\" width=780 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967210/extras/c3c19e3e4f3bc4fe6540f43cafc9bf59.webm?t=1756640696\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967210/extras/c3c19e3e4f3bc4fe6540f43cafc9bf59.mp4?t=1756640696\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After spending seven days with her, will you be able to discover her hidden secret and escape from this small room?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967210/extras/e39e16ee0b7bfcb0e3ab30f6069889b5.poster.avif?t=1756640696\" width=780 height=42 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967210/extras/e39e16ee0b7bfcb0e3ab30f6069889b5.webm?t=1756640696\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2740 <strong>Shiro</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A deceptively serene, pink-haired girl in white.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967210/extras/d572b7819ebba6b5194728c5c35e3398.poster.avif?t=1756640696\" width=780 height=478 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967210/extras/d572b7819ebba6b5194728c5c35e3398.webm?t=1756640696\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967210/extras/d572b7819ebba6b5194728c5c35e3398.mp4?t=1756640696\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967210/extras/bd340d051f17012f2487e66187a71070.poster.avif?t=1756640696\" width=780 height=472 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967210/extras/bd340d051f17012f2487e66187a71070.webm?t=1756640696\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967210/extras/bd340d051f17012f2487e66187a71070.mp4?t=1756640696\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967210/extras/bc45da3e51c9dfbc182dd536a1e7a5ee.poster.avif?t=1756640696\" width=780 height=470 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967210/extras/bc45da3e51c9dfbc182dd536a1e7a5ee.webm?t=1756640696\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967210/extras/bc45da3e51c9dfbc182dd536a1e7a5ee.mp4?t=1756640696\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;Stay here... Stay with Shiro forever and ever and ever and ever and ever and ever and ever.&quot;</i> <br><i>&quot;Why must you always leave me...?&quot;</i> <br><i>&quot;...Tell me how to bring back your smile\u2014the one you once gave only to me.&quot;</i> <br><i>&quot;Isn't this world, just for us two... pure bliss?&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i> </i><br><i>&quot;Watch only me... always...&quot; </i><br><i>&quot;Or this loneliness... will consume us both.&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967210/extras/86d54e3aeecad3bee7e9441d5526b4b6.poster.avif?t=1756640696\" width=780 height=42 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967210/extras/86d54e3aeecad3bee7e9441d5526b4b6.webm?t=1756640696\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2740 Classic anime-inspired story! Make choices based on your preferences to advance the plot.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2740 Immersive environment! Features three time phases - Daytime, Dusk, and Night - that change and progress over time.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2740 Fully animated character art! This short visual novel comes with fully animated character sprites.</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3967210?t=1756640696","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967210/f02720623eeb70d6793511d9d4e0387f3bd674fa/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1756640696","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967210/d21ef286d54f1b8fd22cd88e548c97b7c35e02d9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756640696","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967210/d21ef286d54f1b8fd22cd88e548c97b7c35e02d9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756640696","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Demo Version now available!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The demo includes content from Day 1 and Day 2.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everyone can experience the flow, overall atmosphere, and story tone! (\uff1e\u4eba\uff1c;)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even though we're close to release and working on finalizing the main game (so major framework changes might be difficult), we will definitely fix any bugs with full effort! If you find any bugs, please send them to our email: <a href=\"mailto:1937396015@qq.com\">1937396015@qq.com</a></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you're interested after pla